3}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we conclude that the missing entries are $\\theta =\\frac{5\\pi }{3}$ and $r=2.$" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341903 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341904 13194139535289 true] [17592186341903 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341905 13194139535289 true] [17592186341903 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341906 13194139535289 true] [17592186341903 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341907 13194139535289 true] [17592186341903 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341908 13194139535289 true] [17592186341903 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535289 true] [17592186341903 1041 "selection" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341903 1104 #edb/ref 17592186341908 13194139535289 true] [17592186341903 1110 #uuid "2b629a6f-513f-5115-a3b0-6b4251901494" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341904 1034 "$-\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ and $2$" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341904 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535289 true] [17592186341904 1111 #uuid "feeb27b1-cb7c-5446-b338-972138de8892" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341905 1034 "$\\frac{\\pi }{2}$ and $4$" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341905 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535289 true] [17592186341905 1111 #uuid "7d1fb0b4-96dc-5bd2-a357-956152e1f6c0" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341906 1034 "$\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ and $2$" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341906 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535289 true] [17592186341906 1111 #uuid "9a89a14e-a2ad-5b60-811b-0304e2e1d55e" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341907 1034 "$\\frac{\\pi }{3}$ and  $4$" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341907 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535289 true] [17592186341907 1111 #uuid "4f6e0a11-c354-5dcf-add2-d3f85182c0b5" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341908 1034 "$\\frac{5\\pi }{3}$ and $2$" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341908 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535289 true] [17592186341908 1111 #uuid "e4f1ee4c-5d9c-567d-9af2-bc2f6583bd88" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341909 1017 #edb/ref 17592186341910 13194139535289 true] [17592186341909 1089 "q-40451" 13194139535289 true] [17592186341909 1091 #edb/ref 175